{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17131","headline":"青云干吕 · 王履贞","name":"青云干吕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"异方占瑞气，干吕见青云。\n表圣兴中国，来王谒大君。\n迎祥殊大乐，叶庆类横汾。\n自感明时起，非因触石分。\n暎霄难辨色，从吹乍成文。\n须使流千载，垂芳在典坟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王履贞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17131.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17131","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}